\"/></span></span> Fire<br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poison Gas\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poison_Gas_c58dd6.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></span> Poison</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">13.10.12852<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 28, 2022<br/>Winter Update 2022</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221109154041&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Iks_Churrascan_3f7d23.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see an iks churrascan.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Gnahrgh!</li><li>Yummm!</li><li>Hmmmh!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>When an <a href=\"#/wiki/Iks%20Chuka\">Iks Chuka</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Iks%20Aucar\">Iks Aucar</a>, or <a href=\"#/wiki/Iks%20Pututu\">Iks Pututu</a> dies near one of the Crossed Spears in <a href=\"#/wiki/Iksupan\">Iksupan</a>, there's a chance that 5 <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Iks Churrascan</strong> will spawn. These Churrascan must be swiftly dealt with, as they will disappear if not killed within 15 seconds. However, once all 5 Churrascan are successfully eliminated within the time limit, a single <a href=\"#/wiki/Iks%20Ahpututu\">Iks Ahpututu</a> will spawn. It's important to note that, unlike the Churrascan, once the Iks Ahpuputu appears, it will not disappear after 15 seconds if not killed immediately. Therefore, players must focus on defeating the Iks Churrascan within the 15-second window to ensure the appearance of the formidable Iks Ahpuputu.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Melee</span> (?)</div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility abilityWithScene\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> Dust Beam</span> (?)<div class=\"abilityScene\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"scene_table canvas\" style=\"padding:32px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"tibiatext caster_name\">Iks Churrascan</div><div class=\"hp_bar\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"caster-east\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221109154041&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Iks_Churrascan_3f7d23.gif\"/></div>\n<div